`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Documents"})," (markdown and plain text): Great for anything text-heavy that you'll want to export or continue editing, like meeting notes, reports, project plans, blog posts, and other written content."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Code snippets:"})," Working code in any programming language—Python, JavaScript, C++, and more. You can view the code, copy it, or download it to use in your own projects."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"HTML pages:"})," Complete web pages with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript in a single file. Perfect for landing pages, forms, interactive demos, or quick prototypes."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"SVG images:"})," Scalable vector graphics for logos, icons, illustrations, and other visual elements. These render directly in the artifact window so you can see exactly what you're getting."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Mermaid diagrams:"})," Flowcharts, sequence diagrams, Gantt charts, org charts, and more. Describe the relationships you want to visualize, and Claude will create a diagram you can refine."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"React components:"})," Interactive UI elements with real functionality—calculators, dashboards, games, data visualizations. These aren't just mockups; they include actual logic and respond to user input."]}),`
