`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Share within your organization (Claude for Work):"})," Team and Enterprise users can share artifacts internally with colleagues. The shared artifact stays within your organization and requires team authentication to access."]}),`
