`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Describe the end user."}),' Telling Claude who will use the artifact helps it make appropriate design choices. "This flowchart is for new employees" leads to different results than "This flowchart is for the engineering team."']}),`
